{"product":"Multibot","production_ready":false,"deployment":"dedicated-single-host","summary":"本番導入未達成（L3未完了）。専用単一ホスト方式で、実環境運用の残る受入条件を含む。","areas":[{"area":"Identity","implemented":"実IDP統合（OIDC SSO）、ロールマッピング、トークン管理の実装完了。企業IDPの承認は未達。","remaining": "Production IdP configuration, organization identity policy, MFA enforcement and account lifecycle acceptance","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Production IdP configuration, organization identity policy, MFA enforcement and account lifecycle acceptance"},{"area":"Isolation","implemented":"インストール単位で組織紐付け、アクセスチェック、保護設定を実施。","remaining": "Independent attack review, customer-specific role/connector/egress policy, permission lifecycle acceptance","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Independent attack review, customer-specific role/connector/egress policy, permission lifecycle acceptance"},{"area":"Execution","implemented":"ランごとの予算、単一ホストキュー、操作主体ごとの冪等な受入、労働者リース、中断時レビュー、回復とローカルLLMドリル、依頼者所有のアーティファクト要件を実施済。ワークロード/ロード受容と分散ワーカーは残る。","remaining": "Workload/load acceptance, external-action retry policy, approved availability topology; no distributed workers/HA","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Workload/load acceptance, external-action retry policy, approved availability topology; no distributed workers/HA"},{"area":"Data","implemented":"離線スナップショット/復旧、チェックサム検証、セッション無効化、再開可能なラン削除、age暗号化で検証済み。歴史アーカイブやホスト暗号化の承認政策は残る。","remaining": "Approved retention policy including historical backups/forks/provider copies, host encryption and recovery-key custody, off-site recovery drill, agreed RPO/RTO","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Approved retention policy including historical backups/forks/provider copies, host encryption and recovery-key custody, off-site recovery drill, agreed RPO/RTO"},{"area":"Audit / monitoring","implemented":"アクター監査記録、制限された監査者ロール、分離した収集ユニット/カーソル、準備状況/メトリクス、障害記録を実施。システムドメインデプロイメントと独立した保存は残る。","remaining": "Independent retained/WORM custody, actual alert delivery and escalation, collector supervision deployment, service objectives and incident acceptance","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Independent retained/WORM custody, actual alert delivery and escalation, collector supervision deployment, service objectives and incident acceptance"},{"area":"Deployment","implemented":"固定ランタイム依存、ハードニングコンテナ、ブラウザ/APIチェック、パッケージアドバイザリスキャン、更新/ロールバックと破損回復を実施。ターゲット環境でのアップグレードとセキュリティレビューは残る。","remaining": "Real TLS/DNS environment, identity service, operating owner, target-environment upgrade/rollback and security review","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Real TLS/DNS environment, identity service, operating owner, target-environment upgrade/rollback and security review"},{"area":"Business quality","implemented":"元失敗保持、合成比較一時停止、実ソースv1の欠落チェックとage翻訳誤り記録、出力検証を追加。テン反復実行は残る条件を含む。","remaining": "Ten repeated actual-source runs, source/summary correctness, review miss/false-positive evaluation, latency and acceptance thresholds","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Ten repeated actual-source runs, source/summary correctness, review miss/false-positive evaluation, latency and acceptance thresholds"},{"area":"Contract / operation","implemented":"技術的制限文書化。所有者承認のサービス範囲とSLOの承認は残る。","remaining": "Owner-approved service scope, SLO/SLA, support and incident responsibility; no invented approvals or certifications","source_file":"PRODUCTION_PLAN.md","evidence_quote":"Owner-approved service scope, SLO/SLA, support and incident responsibility; no invented approvals or certifications"}]}